# Exclude non-asset / internal files from public hosting.
# Cloudflare (Workers Static Assets / Pages) serves the repo root as-is; only
# the app's runtime files should be public. Everything below is source,
# tooling, docs, or schema and must NOT be served.
.git
.github
.gitignore
.assetsignore
wrangler.jsonc
wrangler.admin.jsonc
wrangler.toml
node_modules
tests
docs
supabase
# admin/ is the platform control-plane panel -- it has its OWN deploy target
# (admin.fnhub.app). The nation site (fnhub.app / *.fnhub.app) must never serve
# it. Cloudflare Pages reads .assetsignore from its build-output dir, so when the
# admin project's output dir is set to `admin`, this root exclusion doesn't touch
# the admin deploy -- it only keeps admin/ out of the nation deploy.
admin
*.md
*.sql
*.ps1
*.zip
*.log
tools
# Dev-only type-checking config (Phase RX1) -- never served to the browser.
tsconfig.json
types
*.d.ts
